<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Barrett Browning returns three months after diagnosis. Her sputum is down to about a tablespoon a day and she has seen no blood since the first month. She had three nights of restlessness and lighter sleep after the first morphine step and then settled; she has taken no extra doses. She has had twelve grief therapy sessions and has begun to write about her brother, which she could not do before. She has gained almost 2 kg. She would like to take the next small step down. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lungs</td><td>About a tablespoon of sputum a day; no blood; no exacerbation</td></tr><tr><td>Opioid step</td><td>9 mg twice daily for eight weeks; three restless nights, then settled</td></tr><tr><td>Grief therapy</td><td>Twelve sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>43.3 kg</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

